{"title":"Anvil/22","sourceTitle":"Anvil/22/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Bigornas feitas de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Iron\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Iron\">iron</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Iron\" title=\"Iron\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Meteoric_iron\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Meteoric iron\">meteoric iron</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meteoric_iron\" title=\"Meteoric iron\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Steel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Steel\">steel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Steel\" title=\"Steel\"> </a></span>, que possuem alto ponto de fusão, são criadas pela soldagem de duas partes: a base e o topo da bigorna. A forja dessas peças é um processo demorado e pode ser realizada em uma bigorna feita de metal que está 1 camada abaixo. Por exemplo, o ferro (um metal de nível 4) pode ser forjado em uma bigorna feita de bronze (um metal de nível 3).\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111115613\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.003 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.003 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 64/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 411/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 132/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.024      1 -total\n 95.67%    0.980      3 Template:Ll\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:183560-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111115613 and revision id 397178. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[],"revid":397178,"sourceUrl":"https://wiki.vintagestory.at/index.php?title=Anvil%2F22%2Fpt-br","capturedAt":"2026-11-11T11:56:13.877Z"}